                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Finally found a coffee shop that does great straight espressos (and iced long blacks). If you want to taste bean notes and acidity, this is the spot. Most places in TW are either a coffee cocktail of tiramisu and other sugary concoctions or have over-extracted diluted massive americanos.\n\nThe hostess was very welcoming and had I assumed had spent time in the US given her perfect accent.\n\nVibes here are on point as well. Will be trying to come here every morning.",
